---
import ServiceLayout from '../../layouts/ServiceLayout.astro';
---

<ServiceLayout
  serviceName="Maintenance Plumbing"
  serviceSlug="maintenance-plumbing"
  heroTitle="Commercial & Residential Maintenance Plumbing in South-East Queensland"
  heroSubtitle="Scheduled and reactive plumbing maintenance for residential properties, commercial facilities and strata buildings — available 24/7 across Brisbane, Logan, Gold Coast and Ipswich."
  heroImage="/images/maintenance-hero.png"
  heroImageBackground={true}
  keyBenefits={[
    'Scheduled maintenance programmes that prevent costly emergency repairs',
    'Priority 24/7 response for reactive issues — no extra call-out fees',
    'Detailed job reports and photos after every visit',
    'Fixed-rate agreements available for property managers and facility operators',
  ]}
  process={[
    {
      title: 'Initial assessment',
      description: 'We inspect your property or facility and identify existing issues, ageing fixtures and risk areas — then provide a prioritised maintenance plan.',
    },
    {
      title: 'Scheduled programme',
      description: 'We set a regular maintenance calendar around your occupancy, trading hours or building schedule — minimising disruption and catching problems early.',
    },
    {
      title: 'Reactive response',
      description: 'When unexpected issues arise, maintenance clients receive priority dispatch — typically on-site within 60–90 minutes, 24 hours a day.',
    },
    {
      title: 'Documentation & reporting',
      description: 'Every visit is documented with a job report and photos. Maintenance clients receive a periodic summary report for asset records or compliance audits.',
    },
  ]}
  faqs={[
    {
      q: 'What is included in a maintenance plumbing programme?',
      a: 'A maintenance programme typically includes periodic inspections (checking all fixtures, water pressure and drainage), clearing slow or at-risk drains, testing isolation valves, inspecting hot water systems and identifying early-stage leaks. Kitchen appliance servicing — including InSinkErator food waste disposer inspection and maintenance — can also be included. The scope is tailored to your property type and risk profile.',
    },
    {
      q: 'How does preventative maintenance save money?',
      a: 'Most plumbing failures are preceded by warning signs that a trained eye can catch early — slow drainage indicating a developing blockage, a weeping valve fitting, or scale build-up in a hot water system. Fixing these issues during a scheduled visit costs a fraction of what an emergency repair or water-damage claim costs.',
    },
    {
      q: 'Do you offer fixed-price maintenance agreements?',
      a: 'Yes. Property managers, strata bodies, commercial operators and aged care facilities can access fixed-rate maintenance agreements with agreed response time commitments and consolidated monthly invoicing.',
    },
    {
      q: 'What is your response time for reactive maintenance calls?',
      a: 'We aim to be on-site within 60–90 minutes for urgent reactive calls across our service area. For non-urgent reactive work, we typically attend the same day or next day.',
    },
    {
      q: 'Can you handle maintenance across multiple properties?',
      a: 'Yes. We work with property managers, strata managers and commercial operators managing multiple buildings — providing a single point of contact, consistent service standards and consolidated reporting.',
    },
    {
      q: 'What areas do you cover for maintenance plumbing?',
      a: 'We service properties across Logan City, Brisbane (south), Redland City, Gold Coast (north) and Ipswich — more than 130 suburbs within 30 km of Loganholme.',
    },
  ]}
  relatedIndustries={[
    'property-management',
    'commercial-real-estate',
    'retail',
    'aged-care',
    'childcare',
    'education',
  ]}
  metaTitle="Maintenance Plumbing Brisbane & South-East QLD"
  metaDescription="Scheduled and reactive maintenance plumbing for residential and commercial properties across Brisbane, Logan, Gold Coast and Ipswich. 24/7 response, fixed-rate agreements available."
  
/>
